SUMMARY:KATSEYE: WILD HEARTS @ WTW Newquay
DESCRIPTION:KATSEYE: WILD HEARTS (1h 20min)\n\nTwo-time GRAMMY®-nominated g
 lobal girl group KATSEYE is coming to cinemas worldwide with a special the
 atrical release ahead of their third EP\, WILD.\nKATSEYE: WILD HEARTS is 
 a captivating journey into the group's bold new era while celebrating the 
 fans who helped make it possible. Featuring never-before-seen footage\, EY
 EKONS fan videos\, and intimate interviews from the group members\, the fi
 lm explores the powerful bond between KATSEYE and their global fandom. A l
 ove letter to the EYEKONS who helped build this movement\, KATSEYE: WILD H
 EARTS reveals why this group's story is only just beginning.\nFrom the in
 tense pressure of Dream Academy to chart-topping viral success\, audiences
  experience the highs\, setbacks\, sacrifices\, and breakthrough moments t
 hat transformed KATSEYE on their path to global pop stardom. Praised by ou
 tlets including The New York Times\, Vogue\, Rolling Stone\, and Billboard
 \, KATSEYE has earned acclaim for their relentless dedication to their cra
 ft and electrifying live performances. As one of pop's most exciting emerg
 ing global acts\, the group continues to solidify its place as a worldwide
  force.\nFrom the same team that created Netflix's POP STAR ACADEMY\, KAT
 SEYE: WILD HEARTS is produced by Interscope Films and Boardwalk Pictures\,
  in partnership with HYBE X GEFFEN\, and directed by Nadia Hallgren\n\nFil
 m release at WTW Cinemas Newquay\nBook tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/n
 ewquay/film/5621/katseye-wild-hearts\n\nFilm details: https://evenwebb.git
 hub.io/wtw-cinemas/films/katseye-wild-hearts.html
LOCATION:WTW Cinemas Newquay
URL:https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/newquay/film/5621/katseye-wild-hearts
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
