DESCRIPTION:Romeo And Juliet - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season (2h 50min)
 \n\nThe Capulets and Montagues are sworn enemies. Yet it is love at first 
 sight for Romeo Montague and Juliet Capulet when they meet each other at t
 he Capulet ball\, into which Romeo has snuck. The two fall in love and the
 y profess their devotion to each other at Juliet's balcony. They secretly 
